Description:
 linuxmuster-base7 - linuxmuster.net configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.4.13) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(e_fstab.py): drop legacy journaled-quota mount options
     (usrjquota=/grpjquota=) from REQUIRED_MOUNT_OPTIONS and actively strip
     them if already present, and mask the now-redundant
     quotaon-root.service/quotaon.service systemd units, since both
     conflict with the modern ext4 on-disk quota feature this module
     enables. Verified end to end on an upgraded 7.4 host across a real
     reboot.
